      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553874995835711488",
      "text": "@devicerandom You don't need to understand a work of art to express solidarity with its creators after they are murdered for it.",
      "timestamp": "Sat Jan 10 11:24:24 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.538668440636703e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553546571707875331",
      "text": "@pastirka @wikileaks I don't like some of them either. But they have to be republished to show we do not give in.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 13:39:21 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535456563345654e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553573746506989568",
      "text": "@devicerandom @wikileaks http://t.co/PibaJzZnji",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 15:27:20 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535721554355487e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553545874690035712",
      "text": "@xtc_uk @wikileaks Oh hello terrorist sympathizer :)",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 13:36:35 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535432954740736e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553543184593477634",
      "text": "@wikileaks Because \"shocking the audience would be wrong\". No problem publishing the images of the policeman execution though.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 13:25:54 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535427848007926e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553576667466457088",
      "text": "@devicerandom @wikileaks there has been a racist campaign against Muslims in many ways similar to the demonisation of Jews in the 30's",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 15:38:57 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535760445955318e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553575331844849665",
      "text": "@duncanbrown4 @wikileaks This is mostly OK but changes nothing. I am not anti-Muslim. Islam is just a label. *All* religion is the problem.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 15:33:38 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535737465069896e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553545656334565377",
      "text": "@wikileaks No-one publishing them. Seen a couple on Twitter. Don't like them.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 13:35:43 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535427848007926e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553575486895685632",
      "text": "@duncanbrown4 @wikileaks I do respect individual peaceful Xtians, Muslims, Jews etc. I do not have to respect dangerous Neolithic beliefs.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 15:34:15 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535737465069896e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553579125307637760",
      "text": "@duncanbrown4 They defended religious freedom. Including the freedom of being antireligious openly and harshly. Again, please check.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 15:48:43 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5357806336436224e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553594571792584705",
      "text": "@devicerandom @wikileaks Sorry. Didn't mean to mislead you. I'm recalling 50s, 60s, 70s (bit old) when times were not as \"liberal\" as now",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 16:50:05 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535932617059246e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553577397677998081",
      "text": "@duncanbrown4 @wikileaks I know it's a delicate line, no one denies that. But it's necessary. IMHO religion deserves no intellectual respect",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 15:41:51 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535766674664571e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "554284501388369921",
      "text": "@devicerandom No on either question. But the information is easily available in many channels if people want it. It's not being suppressed.",
      "timestamp": "Sun Jan 11 14:31:37 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5401816690159206e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553545296370991104",
      "text": "@wikileaks The Guardian published an editorial explaining exactly why they wouldn't be publishing them.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 13:34:17 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535427848007926e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553573431791611904",
      "text": "@devicerandom I'm glad you can tell the difference coz most Muslims/Jews can't @wikileaks",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 15:26:05 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535721554355487e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553543951282892800",
      "text": "@wikileaks reprinting offensive material accomplishes absolutely nothing, there's enough back-slapping 'we're not afraid' bs already.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 13:28:56 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535427848007926e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553577900172390400",
      "text": "@duncanbrown4 @wikileaks They mocked Christians and Jews in the same rude manner, often in same cartoon or issue.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 15:43:51 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535774559326986e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553652764534767616",
      "text": "@devicerandom @wikileaks You can talk about their art without reprinting their art. It's entirely superfluous.",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 20:41:20 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5357165637207654e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553547521285689345",
      "text": "@devicerandom @wikileaks It's hardly essential. Armed men broke into a media office and murdered people. How is that not enough?",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 13:43:08 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535467649226793e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553571488692203520",
      "text": "@devicerandom @wikileaks so anti Semitism is not racism?",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 15:18:22 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.5357132557571686e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "553547426993557504",
      "text": "@devicerandom @wikileaks their goal is to encourage a divide between Muslims and the rest of the population, reprinting furthers that goal",
      "timestamp": "Fri Jan 09 13:42:45 +0000 2015",
      "parent_id": 5.535462328877834e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    }
